{"time": 1756662397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954837963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1784224029]（感觉不太好接，你再rp一下看看）"}
{"time": 1756662520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718859414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有人吗...”喊一喊，一动也不能动，好无聊，长时间发呆也稍微冷静了一点，师父和露露的声音也逐渐听不清了，还要三天...也许可以争取一下...毕竟其实自己也没什么罪"}
{"time": 1756662601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061643614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=561508463]这里的收押室倒是很宽敞明亮，并不阴冷潮湿，墙上挂着一盏油灯，床铺干爽，此时垫着一层草纸。"}
{"time": 1756662624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028560375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得我是冤枉的...”"}
{"time": 1756662653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854697880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1028560375]“...”过了一会，你听到门外传来动静"}
{"time": 1756662727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63787746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "盯着门看看，也许来人可以放自己出去"}
{"time": 1756662930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681930892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“别在里面嚎了...”来人的声音有些有气无力，“你这不是很精神...啊”"}
{"time": 1756662952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671019770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听听是谁的声音"}
{"time": 1756663230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969154241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯的声音，显得有些没力气"}
{"time": 1756663252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487606553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐你怎么来了，你还是去好好休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1756663495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838601060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "门被推开，西里斯憔悴地走进屋，“我倒是不意外...你会是这个样子。还是走不出来吗？”她翻了个白眼"}
{"time": 1756663550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338008074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到她说这话,又忍不住失落起来“怎么可能走的出来....”"}
{"time": 1756663728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895641078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露是我最好的朋友...师父就像我的第二个妈妈....剩下的大家也都是很好的人...结果就那么突然....”"}
{"time": 1756663748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997234901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我甚至没有见到她们最后一面....”"}
{"time": 1756664022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007990658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1061643614]“……”沉默地坐到床上，百无聊赖，手头什么东西都没有，只能开口，问不知道是谁的某人“这也如你所愿？”"}
{"time": 1756664132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774401455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1997234901]“我都这么说了...”她走进房，坐在之前白发男人坐过的椅子上，看上去已经换了一身衣服，灰色的常服，头发披散在脑后。“你这家伙，要是再这么不听劝，我真的要狠狠抽你耳光了。”"}
{"time": 1756664314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701994206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....感觉这道坎我过不去了...复仇更是奢望...我还是那么弱小，什么都做不到....就算我继续活着...有可能也会继续给周围的人带来灾祸...”"}
{"time": 1756664403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528219900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1007990658]“没什么啦，我们总能逃走的。”‘你’伸出手碰了碰墙壁。隐约可见灰白色的符文，“啧啧，防得真死。”麦哲看了看你，没说话把门安静地锁上了，啪嗒一声。"}
{"time": 1756664578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760392411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=701994206]“...”她看着你，“如果这种难关都迈不过去，之后该怎么成长？”她的手撑着自己的侧脸，看着你的目光带着某种期待"}
{"time": 1756664649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832763462", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到她的话沉默了一会“....西莉丝姐姐不觉得自己说话有点过分么，什么叫这种难关.....”"}
{"time": 1756664669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038370177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到她的话沉默了一会“....西莉丝姐姐不觉得自己说话有点过分么，什么叫这种难关都.....”"}
{"time": 1756665043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766539013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2038370177]“哦...抱歉，但是我不打算推翻我的说法。”"}
{"time": 1756665080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369369094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐倒是挺淡然....像经历了好多次一样..”"}
{"time": 1756665136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588894064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“对于你而言，这也算是...”她眯着眼，“没什么，所以，我会看着你，在这中庭之中。反正，我也没死。”"}
{"time": 1756665179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596287402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐...我感觉你怪怪的....”"}
{"time": 1756665766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338450169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哪里？”她卷了卷自己的发梢，“反正，像诺诺这样怨天尤人，想着一死了之，我绝对不会答应的”"}
{"time": 1756665837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513694938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....西莉丝姐姐还真是坚强啊...”苦笑道"}
{"time": 1756665850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695431308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=528219900]*发呆"}
{"time": 1756666189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959877379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算了”*想了想，敲敲门，喊个人过来"}
{"time": 1756666203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240624056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=513694938]“呃，我其实也没那么坚强，只是比你多知道一些道理。”她站起身，“总之，想要出来，之后要听我的话，明白了吗？”她走到你面前，伸手搭在你的肩膀上"}
{"time": 1756666211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642319514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“能帮我拿本书么？什么书都行，但最好是炼金学科的”"}
{"time": 1756666344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509523803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧......”先出去在说吧，在这里待着什么也做不到“嗯...那西莉丝姐姐可以先放了我吗”"}
{"time": 1756666450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143473508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1642319514]无人回应你的话，透过牢房门，你可以看见旁边的几个牢房里大多关了人在里面，不过那些人看上去都病殃殃，像是被抽干了活力一样。"}
{"time": 1756666705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559390316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=143473508]“好啦，你不会真的打算在这里蹲三天吧？”你注意到自己的眼睛扫了扫其他牢房的人，“在这种地方呆久了真的会发霉的。”"}
{"time": 1756666733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110291194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=509523803]“我得确定你是不是真的想好了。”她低头看了看自己的腹部，“再来一次我可受不了。”"}
{"time": 1756666768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678629679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以当时到底发生了什么...为什么西莉丝姐姐后来出现在了收敛办事厅”"}
{"time": 1756666803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672048956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=143473508]“……真是”*无聊没持续多久，因为很快就是迟来的困意。如果不是阿丽娅注入的火力，恐怕早就该不省人事了，此时有些神志不清，支撑着走回床边“不行了……”"}
{"time": 1756667268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469397253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=678629679]“嗯...”她看着你，从腰间拿出那只你熟悉的指挥棒，“虽然有些被迫，但是被那种像蜘蛛一样的家伙偷袭，就算是我也没办法啦。”"}
{"time": 1756667400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951635979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“蜘蛛？..我记得西莉丝姐姐不是当时和鲁鲁纳伊打了起来么，但那个小天使却说姐姐是被莎木纳克雅伤的...好奇怪”"}
{"time": 1756667594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111415223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1672048956]“诶...困了是？”她的语气有些讶异，“算了，反正一时半会也出不去，现在休息一下也可以。等你醒的时候，只要不疑惑自己为什么在废墟里，我也无所谓。”"}
{"time": 1756667734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814988434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（困了zzz）"}
{"time": 1756667799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238295754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1951635979]“就是那家伙啦。”她的指挥棒搭在束缚你的法阵上，“没想到这次连混融的家伙都混进来了。”"}
{"time": 1756667802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949518086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不该困吗）"}
