{"time": 1756683544, "type": "reply", "message_id": "660530642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D20=7"}
{"time": 1756683551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480887658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（笑了）"}
{"time": 1756683581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504002061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你注意到了其中有几个人影似乎在牢房里见过?"}
{"time": 1756683605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683073664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不知道”*实话实说，倒是没有急着问名字“但我原本只是想睡一觉……”"}
{"time": 1756683619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656443168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过还好你对这里还蛮熟的样子”"}
{"time": 1756683686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905630814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1646670676]她的绿色眼瞳里有着白色的瞳仁，让她看上去显得毫无神采，尽管她说话并不死气沉沉，\"...您不怪我吗？...在休息的时候来了这种地方..\""}
{"time": 1756683740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120015799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=504002061](镜子对面)他们的状态或多或少有些不太对劲，或多或少有些身体部位发黑，个别甚至很露骨"}
{"time": 1756683751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293658396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我嘞个很露骨）"}
{"time": 1756683821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847148453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1905630814]“我有点……习惯了，而且早就知道不会平静”*打了个哈欠“而且这里好像也不是不能睡……”"}
{"time": 1756683848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140462905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但出于……扮演正常人的需要，我还是问一问吧……这是哪？”"}
{"time": 1756684021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628187837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我的安息之所...啊，我叫妃花...\"她牵起自己的裙摆向你低头行礼，\"对不起...我实在没办法...拜托玛文大人做了这个地方...啊啊\""}
{"time": 1756684160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144007389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“原来是这样”*点点头“认识的字拼到一起变成了完全听不懂的句子……”"}
{"time": 1756684240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773312325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我叫伊芙·艾络温·摩根”*回一个同样的礼“不完整之人……方便问一下我为什么会在这里吗？”"}
{"time": 1756684417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608504470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...大概是..被我吸引而来?\"她有些不够肯定，\"和之前...那些...一样...伊芙也想..寻求安息吗？\""}
{"time": 1756684572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405394445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=608504470]“寻求安息？”*摸着下巴，自己也不太确定“可能有一点点……不过肯定不是现在。之前哪些？”"}
{"time": 1756684737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064349953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...渴望安息的人，会被妃花吸引...玛文大人是这么说的。\"她坐下来，手里捧起一束白光，在她手中化成一朵白花，\"不过..妃花觉得，只要大家都温柔待人...世界也会和平的，啊...当然不是说玛文大人错了...\""}
{"time": 1756685007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728650008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1238295754]“混融是什么...”"}
{"time": 1756685024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283424629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=728650008]（醒这么早？）"}
{"time": 1756685026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309240447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1756685110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336643452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你怎么醒了)"}
{"time": 1756685129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791444482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1756685380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202392230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2064349953]“嗯……也许吧”*心说‘大家’和‘温柔’的定义都太宽泛，不过也没有纠正的打算“不过应该不是我已经死了的意思吧……”"}
{"time": 1756685480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945336876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=728650008]\"....好啦，诺诺不用管这些。\"她轻轻敲了敲法阵，瞬间碎成了无数的光片，你感觉束缚同时消失"}
{"time": 1756685540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280712196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐这样做，那群守夜人会不会说什么...”"}
{"time": 1756685545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822399801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=202392230]\"嗯...不是死了哦?要是死了的话...就不算安息吧？\"她的语气认真，\"永远沉睡下去...这才是安息。\"你注意她说这话有些迟疑"}
{"time": 1756685633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846605079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=280712196]\"我还算有几分薄面。\"她收起自己的指挥棒，\"所以，之前给你提的要求，能做到吗？\""}
{"time": 1756685659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685524317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....试试吧”"}
{"time": 1756685677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732651151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……不太对吧”*想了想“毕竟R.I.P只会出现在墓碑上，不会在床头吧”"}
{"time": 1756685795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332015377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1732651151]\"...\"她露出了些纠结的神色，\"但是...玛文大人是这么说的...世人愚昧，便给予永恒的安息。长眠不醒...做一场美梦就好。妃花...妃花也这么想哦\""}
{"time": 1756685865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822544659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己真的可以跨越么,露...不行，不能在想了，在想可能又要坏掉了...但苟活着着真的对吗...."}
{"time": 1756685984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804202989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是承接着活下去的诅咒?)"}
{"time": 1756685990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628842077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(拼尽全力苟活下去?)"}
{"time": 1756686012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102772026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要是...我还能再见露露和师父最后一面.....听听她们的嘱托....也许....”摇摇头“算了...这怎么可能...”"}
{"time": 1756686039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976412707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=332015377]“……如果真的能让所有人都进入平等的美梦……那可能也对”*简单地想了想“从一出生，到死去，都无忧无虑的话……”"}
{"time": 1756686059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769839186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2102772026]（尸体交谈不就好了）"}
