{"time": 1756726306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686135623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*烦躁起来，于是转头向西丽丝“那种东西之后再说，我的东西被放哪去了？”"}
{"time": 1756726344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133936213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你态度能不能好一点...没有西莉丝姐姐的话，你肯定出不去”"}
{"time": 1756726452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522554637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有我的话你们两个都已经死了，哪还有功夫在这坐着”*皱眉“我的东西放哪去了？”"}
{"time": 1756726474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933209966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们两个在那死了...你也说不清”"}
