{"time": 1756835361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672029820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=371098906]他用的劲不小，你的脸上肿了一片，西里斯没回你，而是转头问他，\"这是泰坦定下的规则吗？\""}
{"time": 1756835391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553204348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1204255319]\"当然，十金币足以买下入场券，这世上没有什么事金钱买不到的。\""}
{"time": 1756835391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183181614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "以后一定要买个小本本，大城市的坏人太多了..."}
{"time": 1756835576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633820603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=672029820]\"当然，一切皆可用金钱衡量，没有金钱之人，便剥夺人权。\""}
{"time": 1756835580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451463665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行啊，什么都能买到的话，我姑且一问”"}
{"time": 1756835585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229698009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你的命值多少？”"}
{"time": 1756835618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138889225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(好帅啊龙哥)"}
{"time": 1756835886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781136426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1229698009]\"哦...太棒啦，像我这样的人...居然值得用金钱衡量生命，尊贵的小姐，您只需要五十枚金币，就可以买下我的性命。\""}
{"time": 1756835908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885302158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥可以买两个他）"}
