{"time": 1756836051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649502532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*没看到意料之外的反应，有些无趣。拿一个袋子出来“也不要你的命，但是让其他人也滚远点”"}
{"time": 1756836071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383658824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，借我10金币...以后会还你的”"}
