{"time": 1757005328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055965534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是如果是里榭娜姐姐的话,她想杀我的话....”有些纠结“我应该不会反抗的...”"}
{"time": 1757005393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772791025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=900509613]“怎么啦？”镜子里的自己和卡珊德拉用着你姐姐身体时几乎一模一样，“你很在意吗？”"}
{"time": 1757005513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105029447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1772791025]“眼睛，怎么这么亮？”*眨眨眼“还熄不掉”"}
{"time": 1757005718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282453640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1055965534]\"我就担心会变成这样。\"她轻轻抱了抱你，身体温暖...又柔软，\"别担心...交给我就好了。\""}
{"time": 1757005773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080836693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我相信西莉丝姐姐”此刻就享受被抱着的感觉吧"}
{"time": 1757005788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123044011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐好温暖”"}
{"time": 1757005913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932949397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1105029447]\"还不是你喜欢乱跑，这里可是马纳利亚，发生什么都不奇怪。\"‘你’突然回过头，洗手间的外面明晃晃站着一个人影。"}
{"time": 1757006263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428424136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥呢）"}
